<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-NETHERLANDS BEAT GERMANY 2-1 IN CHAMPIONS TROPHY.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-NETHERLANDS BEAT GERMANY 2-1 IN CHAMPIONS TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a round-robin league match in the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Netherlands beat Germany 2-1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Netherlands - Jacques Brinkman 11, Remco Van Wijk 68</p>
<p>Germany - Michael Bjorn 60.</p>
